<p>muslim pa laeeno'n ki chadaayi hai seher se<br />
tou-e- pa qayamat ghazab aayi hai seher se<br />
aur ek tane tanha pa ladaayi hai seher se<br />
dam lene ki fursat nahi paayi hai seher se</p>

<p>mazloom pa ek nargha-e- afwaaje jafaa hai<br />
yaa'n daayere me nuqta-e- anwaar-e- quda hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zilhij ki navi arfe ka din qatl ka saamaa&rsquo;n<br />
par eid ye ho aap pe hota hu mai qurbaa&rsquo;n<br />
shehzaado'n ka aur shaah ka allah nigehbaa&rsquo;n<br />
karta hu ruqayya ki sifarish magar is aa'n</p>

<p>kudh kudh ke mere gham me na dam uska nikal jaaye<br />
sadqe me sakina ke ruqaiyya meri pal jaaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>al qissa sahar ko huwi aada ki chadhaayi<br />
tou-a- ka makaa'n ghir gaya aafat nahi aayi<br />
chillati thi tou-a- ke duhaayi hai duhaayi<br />
kyu karte hai hyder ke bhatije se ladaayi</p>

<p>kyu lad-ne ko sab aaye ho ye kis se lada hai<br />
bechara mere hujre me faaqe se pada hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sunke baraamad huwa wo naayebe shabbir<br />
baadal ki tarha chaagaye sab zaalim-o- be peer<br />
haato'n me tuli barchiyaa'n chullu se mile teer<br />
padne lagi mazloom pa shamsheer pa shamsheer</p>

<p>deewar pa amboh tha aur baam ke upar<br />
balwa tha ajab muslim-e- naakaam ke upar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ek phainkta tha chob ko aatish se jalaa ke<br />
muslim pa girata tha koi sang uthake<br />
yaa valvale me naara tha ya shere khuda ke<br />
deewar hata dete the ghode ko badha ke</p>

<p>jo padhta tha jab haath kamar baandhe adu par<br />
ghode se wahi'n phainkte the baam ke oopar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nagaah lab-o- danda&rsquo;n pa laga sange-jafakaar<br />
qam hogaye aur mu se lahu daala kayi baar<br />
par dabdaba ye tha ke na paas aate the kaffaar<br />
aaqir ko dagha ki ye pukare wo sitam gaar</p>

<p>phir ladna zara poochlo bhai ki qabar ko<br />
wo naaqa sawaar aata hai kaabe se idhar ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>muddat se suna tha jo na haale shah-e- walaa<br />
ye sunte hi be saaqta talwaar ko roka<br />
bas mu ko phirate hi ajal ne kiya mujra<br />
barchi to kaleje me thi, barchi me kaleja</p>

<p>mu sooe najaf karke kaha apne chacha se<br />
mazloom bhatije ko tere maara dagha se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte hi ghash hogaye ghode se gire haaye<br />
mazloom ko zaalim dare koofa se utha laaye<br />
muslim pe waha pyaas ka ghalba huwa aye waaye<br />
darwaze pe paani ke zaroof unko nazar aaye</p>

<p>darbaano ko dikhlaake zabaa'n bola wo pyaasa<br />
mehmaan hu aur pyaasa hu paani do zara sa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phir tou-a- ne hotou'n se lagaya jo pyala<br />
peene jo lage mu se lahu paani me daala<br />
dandaa'n bhi gire jaam bana qoon ka thaala<br />
ro ro ke pukaare malak-e aalam-e baala</p>

<p>ab saqiye kousar tumhe sairaab karenge<br />
pyase maro shabbir bhi pyase hi marenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hamraa'n ke farzand se haakim huwa goya<br />
ab der na kar baam pa muslim ko tu leja<br />
latka de dare koofa me sar kaat ke iska<br />
aur baam se balaa e zamee'n phainkde laasha</p>

<p>haa baandh ke phir laash ke paau me rasan ko<br />
tash'heer karo muslim-e- aawara watan ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kaabe se isi roz rawana huwe the shaah<br />
muslim to labe gor the shabbir sar-e- raah<br />
jibreel ne koofe ki zamee'n se kaha nagaah<br />
haa'n hukme quda ho to baland itna hi wallah</p>

<p>muslim shahe mazloom ki tasveer ko dekhe<br />
shabbir use dekhe wo shabbir ko dekhe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kufe ki taraf shaah ne chehre ko phiraya<br />
saidaniyo'n ne mahmilo'n se parda uthaya<br />
allah ne muslim ka jamaal unko dikhaya<br />
baitha huwa talwar ke neeche nazar aaya</p>

<p>baaham thi nazaaro'n me sada haaye aqi ki<br />
yaa'n fatima roti thi waha'n rooh ali ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chehrou pa tamanche haram-e- sheh ne lagaaye<br />
milne ke liye haat ruqaiyya ne badhaaye<br />
chillayi ke lo amma wo baba nazar aaye<br />
sab kehte the baba ne waha'n shehr basaaye</p>

<p>naa farsh hai na saaya-e- deewar ke niche<br />
baba to mere baithe hai talwar ke niche<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kya rote ho logo mere baba ko pukaaro<br />
lejaake ruqaiyya ko pidar par koi waaro<br />
zainab phupi ushtar se mujhe jald utaaro<br />
ya hazrate abbas himaayat ko sidharo</p>

<p>deti hu sakina ki qasam jaake bachalo<br />
baba ko mere tegh ke neeche se uthalo<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>